      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loami%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first house on Lick Creek, built in 1818, stands as a reminder of Loami’s early pioneer roots.",
